            "text_hwiVqH": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Emberwood & Hearth is a small-batch, handcrafted home goods brand built around a single belief: the spaces you come home to deserve to feel like somewhere worth being. We're a husband-and-wife studio on Long Island, New York, rooted in natural materials, honest craft, and the art of atmosphere. Everything we make starts with wood and fire. Not as a theme, but as a foundation. You'll find them in every product we make, every material we choose, every detail we obsess over. That's not an accident. It's the whole point.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
