          "blocks": {}
        },
        "text_JcbgLM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This isn't a candle brand that happens to use wood accents. Wood is the backbone of Emberwood & Hearth from the inside out, and it shows up in every single product we make. <em>From the wick that crackles, to the lid that rests on top, to the tray that holds it all in place, wood is present every step of the way. </em>Our candles burn on a wood wick, a thin slice of natural wood that crackles softly as it burns, exactly the way a real fire does. That sound is deliberate. It's part of the experience. Each candle is then capped with a handmade red oak lid, cut and finished by hand in our shop. The lid isn't packaging. It's a piece of woodcraft in its own right. Our handcrafted woodwork extends the same philosophy beyond the candle itself. Locally sourced hardwoods, natural tung oil finishes, clean lines, and surfaces that let the grain do the talking. Our candle trays are made to fit our candles exactly, designed as a set, meant to be used as one.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "custom",
            "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "font_size": "1.125rem",
