            "text_Kha7UN": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Everything is made by hand in small batches. The candles are poured one batch at a time, carefully measured and crafted to burn cleanly and fill a room the way a fire does. Slow, warm, and present. The woodwork is cut, shaped, and finished by hand. The trays are built to fit our candles. The lids are crafted to match. Nothing here is mass produced or outsourced. It's all made by us.</p><p>Small batch isn't a marketing phrase. It's how we hold the quality and intention that makes these products worth owning. When an order leaves here, someone made it by hand. That matters to us, and we think it'll matter to you.</p>",
                "width": "fit-content",
                "max_width": "none",
